1
00:00:00,534 --> 00:00:01,994
(Raj:)Like a Jet Ski.

2
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:05,033
(Howard:)Why do you want a Jet Ski?

3
00:00:05,205 --> 00:00:08,375
(Raj:)All the wealthy and beautiful people
in movies ride Jet Skis.

4
00:00:08,542 --> 00:00:11,042
(Raj:)-That can't just be a coincidence.
HOWARD: Ugh.

5
00:00:11,211 --> 00:00:14,551
(Sheldon:)We can't sell it. We have to keep it
and love it and polish it.

6
00:00:14,714 --> 00:00:17,094
(Sheldon:)Take it out occasionally
when we go to the park...

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,390
...and reenact our favorite scenes
from the movies.

8
00:00:22,347 --> 00:00:23,597
(Howard:)It's sad how great that sounds.

9
00:00:23,765 --> 00:00:24,975
[HOWARD CHUCKLES]

10
00:00:25,142 --> 00:00:28,062
(Leonard:)Guys, it's stolen.
It should go back to Peter Jackson.

11
00:00:28,228 --> 00:00:30,858
(Leonard:)-He made the movies. It belongs to him.
HOWARD: Fine.

12
00:00:31,022 --> 00:00:32,102
(Howard:)He can have it back.

13
00:00:32,315 --> 00:00:35,565
(Howard:)As long as he promises to make me
a hobbit in his next movie.

14
00:00:35,735 --> 00:00:37,405
But there are no Jewish hobbits.

15
00:00:37,571 --> 00:00:41,451
(Howard:)Clearly, you've never been to my house
for dinner on Rosh Hashanah.

16
00:00:41,908 --> 00:00:44,078
(Leonard:)We are not blackmailing Peter--

17
00:00:44,244 --> 00:00:47,874
(Leonard:)-All right, where's the ring?
-You mean my ring?

18
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:50,209
(Leonard:)-What are you doing?
-The ring was unguarded.

19
00:00:50,375 --> 00:00:52,915
It was sitting on the table.
Anyone could've taken it.

20
00:00:53,086 --> 00:00:55,466
(Sheldon:)Proof? I did.

21
00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:56,760
(Leonard:)Give me that.

22
00:00:56,923 --> 00:01:00,023
Be reasonable. We want to do
different things with the ring.

